{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":26466,"name":null,"username":"neon.bit","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/neon.bit/{size}/7536_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-09T17:04:35.723Z","cooked":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26466-ckb-off-chain-hanoi-event-overview-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26466-ckb-off-chain-hanoi-event-overview-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eCKB Off-Chain Hanoi Event Overview\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a39f270082438aa01344fe9970eed7a36db79d4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/9a39f270082438aa01344fe9970eed7a36db79d4\" title=\"hanoi-updated2\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9a39f270082438aa01344fe9970eed7a36db79d4_2_690x388.png\" alt=\"hanoi-updated2\" data-base62-sha1=\"m0lGfbOZOe073HzanzX6M22egWo\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9a39f270082438aa01344fe9970eed7a36db79d4_2_690x388.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9a39f270082438aa01344fe9970eed7a36db79d4_2_1035x582.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9a39f270082438aa01344fe9970eed7a36db79d4_2_1380x776.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"525556\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003ehanoi-updated2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2836×1595 168 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn 8 October 2026, Nervos Community Catalyst, in collaboration with \u003ca href=\"https://www.bpsclub.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eBPSClub\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://www.texlabs.org/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eTexLabs\u003c/a\u003e, held \u003cstrong\u003eCKB Off-Chain Hanoi\u003c/strong\u003e at Nguyen Trai University’s Faculty of Information Technology \u0026amp; Digital Transformation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe event brought together CKB developers, other software developers, faculty members and university students. It was an important milestone for the CKBuilders programme in Vietnam, giving local builders an opportunity to present their work, share their experiences and meet one another in person.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26466-opening-the-event-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26466-opening-the-event-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOpening the Event\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe event was opened by Mr. Trinh Chung, a lecturer at the Faculty of Information Technology \u0026amp; Digital Transformation. He spoke about the importance of blockchain technology and its growing relevance to students and developers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe were encouraged by his openness towards blockchain and his willingness to provide students with exposure to emerging areas of technology. Our conversations with him also provided a useful starting point for exploring how students and the wider university community might participate in future developer activities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"d-image-grid\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/55a8e70aa0e3c9417f4c5aaca20657ddc9e807a6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/55a8e70aa0e3c9417f4c5aaca20657ddc9e807a6\" title=\"TPU_3957\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/55a8e70aa0e3c9417f4c5aaca20657ddc9e807a6_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_3957\" data-base62-sha1=\"cdMskta8yDo658SOEpA3naK75wG\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/55a8e70aa0e3c9417f4c5aaca20657ddc9e807a6_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/55a8e70aa0e3c9417f4c5aaca20657ddc9e807a6_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/55a8e70aa0e3c9417f4c5aaca20657ddc9e807a6_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"9EA7B0\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_3957\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1282 505 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d2a571ab2991e013dfc001b6394460f215569ef8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/d2a571ab2991e013dfc001b6394460f215569ef8\" title=\"TPU_4011\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d2a571ab2991e013dfc001b6394460f215569ef8_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_4011\" data-base62-sha1=\"u3sJjQ9HoC1DkIf8fBDeg3N35X2\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d2a571ab2991e013dfc001b6394460f215569ef8_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d2a571ab2991e013dfc001b6394460f215569ef8_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d2a571ab2991e013dfc001b6394460f215569ef8_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"708294\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_4011\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1282 497 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26466-from-ckb-fundamentals-to-practical-development-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26466-from-ckb-fundamentals-to-practical-development-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFrom CKB Fundamentals to Practical Development\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/longdevbf\"\u003e@longdevbf\u003c/a\u003e delivered the first community presentation, introducing CKB and helping the audience understand some of its core architecture, unique characteristics and the opportunities it offers developers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tung_pham\"\u003e@Tung_Pham\u003c/a\u003e followed with a broad explanation blockchain concepts before discussing CKB, quantum resistance and \u003ca href=\"https://www.quantumpurse.org/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eQuantum Purse\u003c/a\u003e. This provided useful context for attendees with different levels of familiarity with blockchain technology while also demonstrating how CKB’s flexibility translates to embracing quantum-resistant cryptography and a live, audited PQC wallet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJames then presented his hardware-related work involving the integration of Trezor hardware wallets with Quantum Purse. His session demonstrated how CKB’s cryptographic flexibility can be explored through practical development combining hardware and software.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollowing James, \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/retricsu\"\u003e@RetricSu\u003c/a\u003e from CKB DevRel provided an introduction to CKB development via a remote presentation. His session helped connect the earlier discussion about CKB with the practical foundations developers need to begin building.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"d-image-grid\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b32c641431e1a172f7853ce5ea19586578ed7888.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/b32c641431e1a172f7853ce5ea19586578ed7888\" title=\"TPU_4102\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b32c641431e1a172f7853ce5ea19586578ed7888_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_4102\" data-base62-sha1=\"pz2zBMJOil0ViMuxn14YzmgEcre\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b32c641431e1a172f7853ce5ea19586578ed7888_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b32c641431e1a172f7853ce5ea19586578ed7888_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b32c641431e1a172f7853ce5ea19586578ed7888_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"7C9FBD\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_4102\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1282 424 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5c9ba5a1e439c77b89a5810c813699c1cf69946b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/5c9ba5a1e439c77b89a5810c813699c1cf69946b\" title=\"TPU_4189\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c9ba5a1e439c77b89a5810c813699c1cf69946b_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_4189\" data-base62-sha1=\"ddfoLsImDChuqy7gK89tryTyyz9\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c9ba5a1e439c77b89a5810c813699c1cf69946b_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c9ba5a1e439c77b89a5810c813699c1cf69946b_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c9ba5a1e439c77b89a5810c813699c1cf69946b_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"8FB4D0\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_4189\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1282 386 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26466-opportunities-for-developers-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26466-opportunities-for-developers-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOpportunities for Developers\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs there was a substantial student contingent in the audience, my presentation focused on the importance of remaining open-minded as technology evolves. Students entering the industry today are likely to encounter technologies and applications that are still at an early stage (or may not yet exist at all), and blockchain is worth paying attention to as it continues to mature over the next decade. I also introduced the opportunities available through Nervos Community Catalyst, including \u003ca href=\"https://ckbuilders.dev/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eCKBuilders\u003c/a\u003e, Build on CKB, hackathons and other contribution pathways within the CKB ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNgoc continued the programme by sharing his reflections on CKB and discussing his experience of building a \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/nghiadang391/Toy_trading_platform\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eToyTrade marketplace\u003c/a\u003e. His presentation gave the audience insight into the development process from the perspective of someone actively learning about CKB and applying that knowledge to a working project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/timnguyen\"\u003e@timnguyen\u003c/a\u003e concluded the presentations by discussing his experience of building CKB Lab and \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/tiennt0212/FiberGate\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eFiberGate\u003c/a\u003e, a project developed for the recent Fiber Network hackathon. His session showed how participation in CKBuilders and ecosystem hackathons can lead to the development of more substantial tools and projects over time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special note of thanks must be made to \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zz_tovarishch\"\u003e@zz_tovarishch\u003c/a\u003e who adapted his \u003ca href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/t/ckb-mbabel-live-bilingual-captions-for-zh-en-meetings/10593\"\u003eCKB mBabel\u003c/a\u003e tool to support \u003ccode\u003een \u0026lt;\u0026gt; vn\u003c/code\u003e live on-screen translations during proceedings, as well as providing access to Volcengine services. This proved to be an invaluable resource for attendees, ensuring they were well-positioned to engage fully with the content delivered.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"d-image-grid\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d79f59585a921dbb76982c4b0d762f75af53221c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/d79f59585a921dbb76982c4b0d762f75af53221c\" title=\"TPU_4402\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d79f59585a921dbb76982c4b0d762f75af53221c_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_4402\" data-base62-sha1=\"uLu3HVlw1jJzAyx54OIgHjd9nAw\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d79f59585a921dbb76982c4b0d762f75af53221c_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d79f59585a921dbb76982c4b0d762f75af53221c_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d79f59585a921dbb76982c4b0d762f75af53221c_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"607B88\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_4402\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1282 422 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c61390bd4678f9e0f1d76e09fbfa91f44ff59f08.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/c61390bd4678f9e0f1d76e09fbfa91f44ff59f08\" title=\"TPU_4483\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c61390bd4678f9e0f1d76e09fbfa91f44ff59f08_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_4483\" data-base62-sha1=\"sggsnMsVFsUEBSWQxzf4MN7zfzq\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c61390bd4678f9e0f1d76e09fbfa91f44ff59f08_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c61390bd4678f9e0f1d76e09fbfa91f44ff59f08_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c61390bd4678f9e0f1d76e09fbfa91f44ff59f08_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"99B7C6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_4483\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1282 420 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26466-a-growing-builder-community-in-vietnam-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26466-a-growing-builder-community-in-vietnam-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eA Growing Builder Community in Vietnam\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAcross the programme, the speakers covered blockchain fundamentals, CKB development, post-quantum cryptography, hardware integration, application development and Fiber Network. This range reflected the different technical interests already developing within the Vietnamese CKBuilder community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCKBuilder participants from Vietnam now numbers more than 15, with interest continuing to grow largely through personal recommendations and word of mouth. Although CKB community events have previously taken place in the country, CKB Off-Chain Hanoi was the first centred on CKBuilders and the first opportunity for many of them to meet and present their work in person. Their prominent role in the programme reflected the range of knowledge and projects already emerging from the Vietnamese community. Vietnam remains an important focal point because of its strong developer base, wider interest in blockchain and the experience many local developers already have with UTXO-based systems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d8592a33cfaa10f4f620af6374d7aba54de9cc84.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/d8592a33cfaa10f4f620af6374d7aba54de9cc84\" title=\"TPU_4585\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d8592a33cfaa10f4f620af6374d7aba54de9cc84_2_690x438.jpeg\" alt=\"TPU_4585\" data-base62-sha1=\"uRUarsssVBFizZZjCuBiHtwYB6Y\" width=\"690\" height=\"438\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d8592a33cfaa10f4f620af6374d7aba54de9cc84_2_690x438.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d8592a33cfaa10f4f620af6374d7aba54de9cc84_2_1035x657.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d8592a33cfaa10f4f620af6374d7aba54de9cc84_2_1380x876.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"959BA3\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eTPU_4585\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1219 579 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26466-reflections-and-next-steps-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26466-reflections-and-next-steps-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eReflections and Next Steps\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCKB Off-Chain Hanoi was a strong first step for the CKBuilder community in Vietnam. It brought together developers, students and faculty members, created space for practical knowledge to be shared and gave local builders an opportunity to present their work.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe will continue exploring events and other activities in Vietnam, with a view to strengthening relationships between existing CKB builders while welcoming other regional developers who share our interests. The interest shown by the university faculty also creates opportunities for further engagement with students and other developers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe aim is to build upon the connections established at this event and support a community in which local builders increasingly organise activities, exchange knowledge and help introduce other developers to CKB.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T17:04:35.723Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":66,"reads":22,"readers_count":21,"score":403.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":10860,"topic_slug":"ckb-off-chain-hanoi-event-overview","display_username":null,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://github.com/nghiadang391/Toy_trading_platform","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"GitHub - nghiadang391/Toy_trading_platform: Secure toy trading marketplace on Nervos CKB featuring on-chain provenance (Spore DOBs) and custom escrow settlements. · GitHub","clicks":2},{"url":"https://www.texlabs.org/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"TEX Labs — Platform Engineering, Cloud \u0026 SaaS","clicks":0},{"url":"https://www.quantumpurse.org/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Quantum Purse - Quantum-Safe Desktop Wallet for CKB","clicks":0},{"url":"https://www.bpsclub.com/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Blockchain Pioneer Student - UTC Blockchain Club","clicks":0},{"url":"https://github.com/tiennt0212/FiberGate","internal":false,"reflection":false